# This is the project-level override of ESP-IDF's builtin `mbedtls` component.
#
# esp-pqc's own mbedTLS options (CONFIG_MBEDTLS_USE_BUNDLED_PQC and the hybrid
# PQC TLS features) are NOT defined here. They sit next to this file in
# Kconfig.pqc, which the root esp-pqc Kconfig pulls in with rsource so they stay
# grouped under "Post-Quantum Cryptography (esp-pqc)" -> "mbedTLS". They must
# stay out of this file: ESP-IDF reads this one automatically as the override
# component's Kconfig, so anything the root Kconfig also sourced would end up
# defined twice.
#
# This file exists solely so the override component keeps re-exposing the default
# ESP-IDF mbedTLS options; without the source line below every CONFIG_MBEDTLS_*
# from $IDF_PATH would disappear from the build.

source "$IDF_PATH/components/mbedtls/Kconfig"
